  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"article-table\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr style=\"font-size:18px;\">\n<th>Template documentation follows\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i>Note: the template above may sometimes be partially or fully invisible.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Visit <span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Refbegin/doc (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6UmVmYmVnaW4vZG9jP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Template:Refbegin/doc</span> to edit this documentation. (<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Documentation\" title=\"Template:Documentation\">How does this work?</a>)\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div style=\"margin:0 1em;\">\n<span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Refbegin/doc (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6UmVmYmVnaW4vZG9jP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Template:Refbegin/doc</span></div>\n<div class=\"templatedata-header\">This is the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TemplateData\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:TemplateData\">TemplateData</a> documentation for this template used by <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/VisualEditor\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:VisualEditor\">VisualEditor</a> and other tools.\n<p><b>Refbegin</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<section class=\"mw-templatedata-doc-wrap\"><header><p class=\"mw-templatedata-doc-desc\">This template is used to start formatting for a reference list or bibliography. </p></header><table class=\"wikitable mw-templatedata-doc-params sortable\"><caption><p class=\"mw-templatedata-caption\">Template parameters<mw:edittemplatedata page=\"Template:Refbegin/TemplateData\"></mw:edittemplatedata></p></caption><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\">Parameter</th><th>Description</th><th>Type</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Columns</th><td class=\"mw-templatedata-doc-param-name\"><code>1</code></td><td><p>Specify number or width of columns.</p><dl></dl></td><td class=\"mw-templatedata-doc-param-type\">Number</td><td class=\"mw-templatedata-doc-param-status-optional\" data-sort-value=\"0\">optional</td></tr><tr><th>colwidth</th><td class=\"mw-templatedata-doc-param-name\"><code>colwidth</code></td><td><p>Width of columns eg '25em' the default is '30em'.</p><dl></dl></td><td class=\"mw-templatedata-doc-param-type\">String</td><td class=\"mw-templatedata-doc-param-status-optional\" data-sort-value=\"0\">optional</td></tr><tr><th>Hanging indent</th><td class=\"mw-templatedata-doc-param-name\"><code>indent</code></td><td><p>Set to \"yes\" to use hanging indent if an individual reference wraps over more than one line in the browser's display window.</p><dl></dl></td><td class=\"mw-templatedata-doc-param-type\">String</td><td class=\"mw-templatedata-doc-param-status-optional\" data-sort-value=\"0\">optional</td></tr><tr><th>indentsize</th><td class=\"mw-templatedata-doc-param-name\"><code>indentsize</code></td><td><p>Amount of indent in em units. Default is '3.2'</p><dl></dl></td><td class=\"mw-templatedata-doc-param-type\">Number</td><td class=\"mw-templatedata-doc-param-status-optional\" data-sort-value=\"0\">optional</td></tr></tbody></table></section>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205523\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 24/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1135/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1831/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.621      1 -total\n 72.03%    6.930      1 Template:Refbegin/TemplateData\n 27.20%    2.617      1 Template:Documentation\n 15.41%    1.483      1 Template:TemplateDataHeader\n  9.57%    0.921      1 Template:Refbegin/doc\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache w